# Downloaded llama-server sidecar + its dylibs (fetched via
# scripts/download-llama-server.sh; too large / platform-specific to commit).
llama-server-*
# `lib`, NOT `lib/`: a trailing slash matches only a DIRECTORY. When the
# real lib/ was replaced by a symlink, this pattern stopped matching and
# `git add -A` committed the symlink — which pointed at itself, so dyld
# failed with ELOOP and the sidecar died on every start (see #350).
lib
